            lines {
              text: "# Manager101 - Management Models Reference App"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "Manager101 is a comprehensive, offline-first native Android application built with Jetpack Compose and Material 3. It serves as an executive reference guide to 180 management models, leadership frameworks, decision-making techniques, business strategy, quality improvement, project management, finance, and productivity."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## User Review & Critical Decisions"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> [!IMPORTANT]"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> Based on your preferences, the following decisions are locked in for implementation:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Visual Theme**: Deep Navy and Emerald Green executive palette with high contrast and polished Material 3 components."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Authentication & Feature Scope**: Full library of 180 models across 9 categories, with Firebase Authentication (Google Sign-In) and cloud-backed favorites persistence, plus full offline access."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Illustrations**: Custom Jetpack Compose Canvas vector diagrams and visual charts for every single model detail page."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed Decision 1**: All 180 category entries across 9 categories will be fully implemented with professional definitions, steps, workplace examples, advantages, limitations, key takeaways, and related models."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed Decision 2**: Firebase Authentication + Firestore will be configured for secure Google Sign-In and cloud sync of saved favorites, while the entire model database is bundled locally for instant offline browsing and searching."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Provides structured, concise, and professional reference guides for 180 essential management and strategic frameworks."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience**: Managers, executives, team leads, business analysts, students, and professionals seeking practical frameworks."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**: Instant offline access to actionable business models accompanied by clean vector canvas illustrations and personal favorite bookmarking."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key User Flows**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. **Authentication / Welcome**: Secure Google Sign-In (with guest/offline bypass option if desired) welcoming users to Manager101."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. **Home Screen**: App branding, quick search bar, 9 category cards with item counts, and featured models."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  3. **Library / Browse**: Comprehensive alphabetical list or category view with real-time search filtering across names, abbreviations, keywords, and definitions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  4. **Favorites**: Quick access to bookmarked models synced across sessions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  5. **Model Detail View**: Clean, scrollable reference card containing model metadata, definition, purpose, when to use, step-by-step guide, workplace example, pros/cons, key takeaway, and **a custom Canvas vector illustration** (e.g., Eisenhower 4-quadrant matrix, SWOT diagram, Porter\'s Five Forces, PDCA cycle, etc.)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  6. **Settings**: Account info, sign out, privacy policy, terms of use, and app version."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Visual Identity & Theme**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Aesthetic Direction**: Executive professional dark-capable palette featuring Deep Navy (`#0A1128` / `#121E36`), Emerald Green accents (`#10B981` / `#059669`), crisp white cards, and slate gray typography."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Color Palette**: M3 ColorScheme with primary Emerald, secondary Navy container, surface tint, and high readability."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Typography**: Clean system sans-serif hierarchy with bold display titles and readable body text."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Component Styling**: M3 Cards with tonal elevation, pill-shaped category chips, interactive ripple feedback, and edge-to-edge layout with proper window insets."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Architecture"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Data Strategy**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Local Model Catalog**: Bundled as a robust static Kotlin repository containing all 180 models across 9 categories, ensuring instant zero-latency offline loading."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **User Favorites & Sync**: Firestore user subcollection (`users/{uid}/favorites/{modelId}`) for cloud-backed favorites when authenticated, with local Room/DataStore fallback for offline state."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Illustration Strategy**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
