  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built **Manager101**, a complete, lightweight, offline-first native Android reference application for management models and leadership frameworks.\n\n### Summary of Implementation:\n- **Architecture & UI**: Built with Jetpack Compose and Material 3, featuring an executive **Deep Navy and Emerald Green** visual theme, custom Canvas vector illustrations for every model, and edge-to-edge support.\n- **Complete Library**: Fully implemented all 180 required models across 9 core management categories (General Management, Decision-Making, Communication, Operations, Project Management, Performance, Risk Management, Financial Management, and Time Management).\n- **Interactive Features**: Instant offline search, category filtering, bookmarking/favorites with Firestore cloud sync, and structured detail pages (definitions, purpose, when to use, step-by-step guides, workplace examples, pros/cons, and key takeaways).\n- **Authentication**: Secure Google Sign-In via Jetpack Credential Manager and Firebase Auth, with seamless offline guest access."
